---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="お問い合わせ | KIZUNA Works"
  description="KIZUNA Worksへのお問い合わせページです。お気軽にご連絡ください。"
  ogTitle="お問い合わせ | KIZUNA Works"
  ogDescription="KIZUNA Worksへのお問い合わせはこちらから"
  ogUrl="https://kizuna-works.jp/contact/"
  canonical="https://kizuna-works.jp/contact/"
>
  <style is:global>
    body { background-color: #f4f7f6; }

    .page-header {
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(27,58,107,0.45) 0%, rgba(42,82,152,0.4) 100%),
        url('/images/contact-bg.png') center center / cover no-repeat;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .page-header p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .contact-section {
      background-color: #f4f7f6;
      padding: 80px 20px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .contact-card {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .contact-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1B3A6B, #2E8B2E);
    }

    .contact-icon {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      background: #F0F4F8;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
      color: #1B3A6B;
    }

    .contact-icon svg {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .contact-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: #1B3A6B;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .contact-card p {
      color: #4a5568;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .btn-form {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px 36px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 40px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      background-color: #2E8B2E;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(46,139,46,0.25);
    }

    .btn-form svg {
      margin-left: 8px;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-form:hover {
      background-color: #1B3A6B;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(27,58,107,0.3);
    }

    .btn-form:hover svg {
      transform: translateX(4px) translateY(-4px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .page-header { padding: 50px 20px; }
      .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      .contact-section { padding: 50px 15px; }
      .contact-card { padding: 40px 20px; }
      .contact-card h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
      .btn-form { padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 1rem; width: 100%; }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>お問い合わせ</h1>
    <p>お気軽にご連絡ください</p>
  </section>

  <main class="contact-section">
    <div class="contact-card">
      <div class="contact-icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M4 7.00005L10.2 11.65C11.2667 12.45 12.7333 12.45 13.8 11.65L20 7"></path>
          <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2>お問い合わせフォーム</h2>
      <p>製品・サービスに関するご質問、ご要望などお気軽にお問い合わせください。<br>通常2〜3営業日以内にご返信いたします。</p>
      <a href="https://forms.gle/2yFVaQmB9RppwiTE6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-form">
        お問い合わせフォームを開く
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M7 17L17 7"></path>
          <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
